<title>FINLAND: LEMMINKAINEN SEES CHANCES FOR PROFIT RISE.</title>
<headline>LEMMINKAINEN SEES CHANCES FOR PROFIT RISE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group Lemminkainen Oy said on Friday the improved outlook on the construction market meant chances for higher net sales and a better profit this year.</p>
<p>&quot;There are chances for growth in net sales and better earnings,&quot; it said in a statement with its 1996 results which showed a 74 million markka profit before extraordinary items, up from 58 million in 1995.</p>
<p>It said the orderstock was higher than a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
</text>
